# The key that closes the list of places (fixtures/bonuslist: the
# outside save with inventory object 26, the game's flag 26 at byte 32,
# and the CD's LBA.CFG). Shift opens the inventory, Right six times and
# Down twice go to the list, Return reads it, and Escape, held, closes
# it. In LBA.EXE the next frame takes Escape for the quit menu, which
# opens. Waited for, its release lets play go on.
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 12
shot start
key Shift_L
sleep 3
key Right Right Right Right Right Right
sleep 1
key Down Down
sleep 1
shot inventory
key Return
sleep 6
shot list
hold 0.4
key Escape
hold 0.15
sleep 3
shot end
